      en: ["Bebuloh is located 10 km northeast of Bandar Seri Begawan city center.", "The village population is approximately 5,000 residents.", "Masjid Bebuloh was built in 1992 and can accommodate 500 worshippers.", "The nearest primary school, Sekolah Rendah Bebuloh, opened in 1985.", "Bebuloh covers an area of 3.2 square kilometers.", "The area receives an average annual rainfall of over 3,000 mm."],
